[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left and right\nsides)</p><p>1. Unscrew the bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the duct.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018311.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the air duct is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Position the duct.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p>Check that air seal is intact when the\nduct is fitted.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a></p><p>1. Remove the duct (1a) releasing it from the duct (1b) and from\nthe climate control casing coupling (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018312.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the duct is not damaged.</p><p>Fit the duct in place.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a></p>"]]